# Chrome profile written by scripts/check-ops-theme-redraw.mjs. Kept in the
# repository rather than a temp directory so the path is the same on a laptop
# and on the runner. The check deletes it after Chrome has exited; ignored for
# the run interrupted before it gets that far, and for the one where Chrome
# never exits, which the check reports when it gives up.
.ops-theme-redraw-*/
